OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Ffurther rain at times, heavier over
OL,7,Fwestern areas at first but the rain
OL,8,Fbecoming more persistent across Angus
OL,9,Fovernight while turning lighter in the
OL,10,Fwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FMainly cloudy with further
OL,13,Frain at times, though it will become
OL,14,Fdrier and perhaps a bit brighter later.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,17,FThursday mainly dry, sunny. Chance of
OL,18,Fpersistent heavy rain on Friday, then
OL,19,Fbright with sunny intervals and a few
OL,20,Fshowers on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
